  "A roof pitched under its covering's least pitch is warned of, as it may not shed water.": "Un toit dont la pente est inférieure à la pente minimale de sa couverture est signalé, car il risque de ne pas évacuer l’eau.",
  "A set of your own, started from the residential one": "Un jeu à vous, parti du jeu résidentiel",
